Package: Householder
Title: Construction et Utilisation des Matrices de Householder
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Marie", "NGON", email="mariengonndag@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for constructing Householder vectors
